ive quest and tutorial state transitions\",\"domain\":\"campaign\",\"targets\":[\"shared\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0001\",\"REQ-0002\",\"REQ-0005\",\"REQ-0008\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"Original-content-neutral dialogue, quest, tutorial, and campaign state rules make required progression explicit and idempotent.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0004\",\"IMP-0013\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"src/core/campaign/{quest,dialogue,tutorial}*\",\"tests/core/campaign/quest*\"],\"data\":[\"quest and tutorial envelopes\"],\"api\":[\"progression commands\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"authored story\",\"branching campaign\",\"user content\",\"UI\"],\"verification\":\"Repeated completion and invalid predicates are rejected safely.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"GATE-0004 before authored text, locale, and content detail.\",\"complexity\":\"high\",\"status\":\"ready_for_authoring\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"IMP-0015\",\"title\":\"Define deterministic encounter and reward resolution contract\",\"domain\":\"campaign\",\"targets\":[\"shared\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0003\",\"REQ-0005\",\"NFR-0002\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"A deterministic encounter, legal-action, defeat, and one-time reward contract supports the first battle without values or presentation.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0003\",\"IMP-0004\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"src/core/campaign/{encounter,reward}*\",\"tests/core/campaign/encounter*\"],\"data\":[\"encounter and reward envelope\"],\"api\":[\"encounter commands\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"multiplayer\",\"live balance\",\"art/audio\",\"mid-combat save guarantee\"],\"verification\":\"Invalid actions do not mutate and reward IDs grant once.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"GATE-0004 before concrete party, enemy, and balance shapes.\",\"complexity\":\"high\",\"status\":\"ready_for_authoring\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"IMP-0016\",\"title\":\"Define safe inventory and party progression contract\",\"domain\":\"campaign\",\"targets\":[\"shared\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0004\",\"REQ-0008\",\"NFR-000